saying this.

00:09:59.164 --> 00:10:02.334
Wait. First, can I have
calming music, please?

00:10:02.334 --> 00:10:04.836
[ Soft music plays ]
Thank you.

00:10:04.836 --> 00:10:09.141
[Bleep] you, you cretinous
insurrectionist gargoyles!

00:10:09.141 --> 00:10:11.110
Of course, you guys
want to move on!

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:13.045
The kid who [Bleep] himself
at prom

00:10:13.045 --> 00:10:15.014
is the one who always wants
to shift the conversation

00:10:15.014 --> 00:10:16.515
to everyone's summer plans.

00:10:16.515 --> 00:10:18.951
"So, Gary, it happened
during the Macarena?"

00:10:18.951 --> 00:10:21.820
"It doesn't matter
when it happened!

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:24.056
Tell me about your internship."

00:10:24.056 --> 00:10:27.560
You guys incited a violent mob
that rampaged across the Capitol

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.027
trying to overthrow
the government,

00:10:29.027 --> 00:10:31.597
and now you want us to
see unity and healing?

00:10:31.597 --> 00:10:33.866
I'd call you
craven, soulless ghouls,

00:10:33.866 --> 00:10:36.302
but in the case
of these seditionist dip[Bleep],

00:10:36.302 --> 00:10:38.170
they're more like
soul-devouring ghouls.

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:40.072
"I love a good
Southern-fried soul

00:10:40.072 --> 00:10:42.707
with a side of peach tea
and pecan pie."

00:10:42.707 --> 00:10:45.111
How can we find unity

00:10:45.111 --> 00:10:48.580
with people who literally
want a confederacy?

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.716
But when it came to faux,
self-serving

00:10:50.716 --> 00:10:52.317
"Let's lower the temperature"
rhetoric,

00:10:52.317 --> 00:10:55.921
the cake was taken by future
former First Lady Melania Trump.

00:10:55.921 --> 00:10:58.089
-First Lady Melania Trump
has just released a statement

00:10:58.089 --> 00:11:00.592
regarding last week's protests.
She writes, in part,

00:11:00.592 --> 00:11:02.795
"I am disappointed and
disheartened

00:11:02.795 --> 00:11:05.431
with what happened last week.
I find it shameful

00:11:05.431 --> 00:11:07.433
that surrounding
these tragic events

00:11:07.433 --> 00:11:11.837
there's been salacious gossip,
unwarranted personal attacks,

00:11:11.837 --> 00:11:15.040
and false misleading accusations
on me

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:17.142
from people who are looking
to be relevant

00:11:17.142 --> 00:11:18.543
and have an agenda."

00:11:18.543 --> 00:11:21.380
-And let me
make something clear!

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:24.116
Whether you're a Republican
or a Democrat,

00:11:24.116 --> 00:11:26.152
seditionist or
law-abiding citizen,

00:11:26.152 --> 00:11:29.221
you leave this poor woman alone!

00:11:29.221 --> 00:11:31.824
And this woman and this one!

00:11:31.824 --> 00:11:33.825
Because any one of them
could be her.

00:11:33.825 --> 00:11:37.295
And better safe than sorry.
I mean, how dare you?

00:11:37.295 --> 00:11:39.932
Salaciously gossip
about this woman

00:11:39.932 --> 00:11:42.968
after she "be best" for you!

00:11:42.968 --> 00:11:47.505
For you!
She's bester than any of you!

00:11:47.505 --> 00:11:51.310
She reher-- She refurbished
and "reherbished."

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:54.146
[ Laughter ]
That's how best she is!

00:11:54.146 --> 00:11:57.382
Did them both! Two for one.
Saved your money!

00:11:57.382 --> 00:12:02.254
She refurbished the White House
tennis pavilion for you!

00:12:02.254 --> 00:12:04.623
[ Laughter ]
Not for her.

00:12:04.623 --> 00:12:06.891
You think she has time
to play tennis

00:12:06.891 --> 00:12:09.795
between sending messages
via jacket

00:12:09.795 --> 00:12:12.264
and hating Christmas
with all of her heart?

00:12:12.264 --> 00:12:15.634
At this point,
the only acceptable option,

00:12:15.634 --> 00:12:18.303
and the bear minimum for the
preservation of our democracy

00:12:18.303 --> 00:12:21.240
is the immediate removal and
prosecution of Donald Trump

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:22.841
for sedition
and the expulsion

00:12:22.841 --> 00:12:25.144
of anyone
who aided him in this coup,

00:12:25.144 --> 00:12:27.012
including the likes
of Josh Hawley and Ted Cruz,

00:12:27.012 --> 00:12:28.814
and Alabama Congressman
Mo Brooks,

00:12:28.814 --> 00:12:30.549
who whipped up the mob
into a frenzy

00:12:30.549 --> 00:12:32.083
before it stormed the Capitol.

00:12:32.083 --> 00:12:34.253
And then, after that, we need
immediate far-reaching

00:12:34.253 --> 00:12:35.988
structural reforms
to our democracy.

00:12:35.988 --> 00:12:37.255
If you're a right-wing pundit,

00:12:37.255 --> 00:12:39.925
maybe try to summon
the same sense of

00:12:39.925 --> 00:12:42.394
outrage and urgency
over losing our democracy

00:12:42.394 --> 00:12:43.895
